---
const savingsFactors = [
  { title: 'Electricity Tariff Slabs', desc: 'Commercial and higher slab residential consumers pay higher rates per kWh, yielding higher financial offset per solar unit generated.' },
  { title: 'Self-Consumption Ratio', desc: 'Consuming solar energy immediately on-site avoids purchasing expensive retail grid power.' },
  { title: 'Grid Export & Net Metering Rules', desc: 'Surplus energy exported to the grid is credited according to local DISCOM net metering or gross metering tariffs.' },
  { title: 'System Yield & O&M', desc: 'Clean panels, optimal tilt, and unshaded exposure maximize annual energy production (kWh/kWp/year).' }
];
---

<section id="solar-savings" class="py-20 bg-slate-50 border-b border-slate-200/80">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-center mb-16">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-solar-100 border border-solar-200 text-solar-900 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider mb-4">
        Financial Realities & Transparency
      </div>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold font-heading text-slate-900 tracking-tight">
        How Much Can Solar Save?
      </h2>
      <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-600 mt-4 leading-relaxed">
        Solar financial savings are derived from displacing grid energy purchases with lower-cost self-generated solar power.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- No Guarantees Warning Box -->
    <div class="mb-12 p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-300 shadow-sm max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start gap-4">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-900 text-solar-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg shrink-0">
          🛡️
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-slate-900">
            Our Principle of Financial Integrity & Facts
          </h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-slate-600 mt-1 leading-relaxed">
            VAC Solar does <span class="font-bold text-slate-900">NOT</span> guarantee zero electricity bills, fixed payback periods, or rigid ROI figures. Energy savings depend on weather conditions, seasonal load changes, tariff policy revisions, and proper system maintenance. All projections provided during site consultation are indicative engineering estimates.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Factors Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6 mb-16">
      {savingsFactors.map((f, i) => (
        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white border border-slate-200 shadow-card-soft">
          <div class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-solar-700 mb-2">FACTOR 0{i+1}</div>
          <h4 class="text-lg font-bold font-heading text-slate-900 mb-2">{f.title}</h4>
          <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">{f.desc}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>

    <!-- Indicative Energy Savings Visualizer -->
    <div class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900 text-white border border-slate-800">
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-center justify-between gap-6 mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-slate-800">
        <div>
          <span class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-solar-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Indicative Financial Illustration</span>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold font-heading text-white mt-1">Understanding Energy Bill Displacement</h3>
        </div>
        <div class="px-3 py-1.5 rounded-lg bg-slate-800 text-xs font-mono text-slate-300 border border-slate-700">
          Status: Indicative Model Only
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-8 items-center">
        <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-slate-300">
          <p>
            When a property consumes power generated by its rooftop solar panels, every kilowatt-hour (kWh) produced directly offsets a unit of power that would otherwise be billed at utility tariff rates.
          </p>
          <p>
            For commercial consumers on higher tariff slabs (e.g. ₹8 - ₹11/unit), offset value per unit generated is substantially higher, accelerating overall lifecycle return on investment.
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-2 pt-2 text-xs text-slate-400">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-solar-400"></span>
              Peak daytime load offset yields highest savings per unit
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
              Net Metering credits export excess units during weekends or low load
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800 space-y-4">
          <div class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-slate-400">Example Daily Load Offset Breakdown</div>
          
          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-medium mb-1">
              <span class="text-slate-300">Grid Power Draw without Solar</span>
              <span class="text-red-400 font-mono">100% Utility Billed</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 overflow-hidden">
              <div class="w-full h-full bg-red-500/80"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <div class="flex justify-between text-xs font-medium mb-1">
              <span class="text-slate-300">With 5 kW Solar PV Array (Daytime Offset)</span>
              <span class="text-solar-400 font-mono">~60% - 80% Solar Covered</span>
            </div>
            <div class="w-full h-3 rounded-full bg-slate-800 flex overflow-hidden">
              <div class="w-[70%] h-full bg-solar-400"></div>
              <div class="w-[30%] h-full bg-slate-700"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="pt-4 border-t border-slate-800 flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
            <span class="text-slate-400">Want an exact custom tariff analysis?</span>
            <a href="/#lead-form" class="font-bold text-solar-400 hover:underline">Get Custom Assessment →</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
